items.headline:
Hamdan bin Zayed witnessed the signing of a partnership between 
@EADTweets
 and the Abu Dhabi Nature Academy on areas including the use of monitoring technologies, smart environmental conservation, eco-tourism management, and developing leadership and operational skills.

In the presence of Hamdan bin Zayed, 
@EADTweets
 has partnered with the Abu Dhabi Nature Academy to launch a training programme that strengthens rangers’ capabilities in the Sheikh Zayed Protected Areas Network, supporting effective sustainable management.

Hamdan bin Zayed visited 
@adihex
 2026 and met exhibitors and participants, commending its role in passing UAE’s cultural heritage on to future generations and its standing as a global platform gathering experts, specialists, decision-makers and enthusiasts from around the world
